  "notes": "Mere Medical demo summary page. Deep navy (#09384e) sidebar with lighter active pill, teal (#006183) header bar. Content panels are thin-outlined rounded (8px) boxes in a 2-column masonry-like grid, each with a bold heading and chevron collapse toggle. Medication names render in uppercase bold as they come from EHR source data, mixing with lower-case entries. Lab rows have tiny light-blue sparkline buttons that expand an inline line chart with shaded normal-range band and a toggle to table view. 'Edit Layout' at bottom allows rearranging widgets. Only shadowed element is the welcome toast."
